{
  "_note": "Synthetic retrieval evaluation set: a labelled corpus plus 40 queries. Tune on 'dev' only; report 'heldout'. Hybrid retrieval and reranking are experiments gated on these numbers, not architectural requirements. 'forbid' lists memories that must never be returned (stale source version, deleted, other project under a project filter, other user). 'stale' lists superseded decisions that may be returned as history but must not outrank the current one.",
  "report_rule": "Fix the embedder and evidence budget across arms, and report latency so added computation is visible. Fixture-embedder numbers only prove the harness runs; they say nothing about production quality.",
  "sources": [
    {"id": "src_cerno_cache", "user": "user_a", "current_version": 1},
    {"id": "src_cerno_queue", "user": "user_a", "current_version": 1},
